          .proof
            %h6 Proof
            %p
              On
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/underlying"} underlying
              groupoids the isomorphism is induced by a choice of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjoint+equivalence"} adjoint
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/deformation+retraction"} deformation retraction
              onto a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/skeletal+groupoid"} skeletal groupoid
              (spelled out
              = succeed ")." do
                %a{:href => "Introduction+to+Topology+--+2#EveryGroupoidIsomorphicToQuasiSkeletalGroupoid"} here
            %p
              It remains to observe that every local system on
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
